{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2019",
    "module": "ES2015",
    "moduleResolution": "node",
    "strict": true,
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "forceConsistentCasingInFileNames": true,
    "resolveJsonModule": true,
    "noEmit": true,
    "baseUrl": ".",
    "paths": {
      "@/*": ["assets/scripts/*"]
    }
  },
  "include": ["assets/scripts/**/*.ts"],
  "exclude": ["node_modules", ".sim-out", "tools"],
  "comments": [
    "编辑器侧配置：'cc' 类型由 Cocos Creator 3.x 内置提供，本仓库不自带引擎声明文件。",
    "纯逻辑层（core/battle）的独立类型检查与无头模拟请使用 tsconfig.sim.json（npm run typecheck / npm run sim）。"
  ]
}
